   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, mac/M1-r728-fable, 1b290ada): REQUEST CHANGES**\n\n1. **Medium** — `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md:612`, \"What gives user1 the grey key is not known (no colour setting on profile pages 2, 3, 6, 7 of user2)\". Page 3 has one: the « Couleurs : » row « Modifier les couleurs du forum » → `/setperso.php?config=hfr.inc`, in the run's P728p3 and in the committed `R55-p3-profile-edit-page3.html:190-191` that the same sentence cites. Not fetched. Page 2 also passes `couleurTab12=#F7F7F7` (the key's 12th field; user1's is `aaaaaa`) to its preview iframe. Failure: LOT-193 or the next capture session reads \"not known\" and never looks at `setperso.php`. Fix: replace the parenthesis with \"profile page 3 links `/setperso.php?config=hfr.inc` (« Modifier les couleurs du forum », `R55-p3`), not fetched, pending capture; pages 2, 6, 7 hold no colour field (page 2's hidden `couleurTab12` is the key's 12th field, run observation)\".\n2. **Low** — #728 criterion 3 (LOT-193 told the paths): #734's comment lists `R728a`/`R728b` only; add `R728c` after the merge. Criterion 1 for the logo (no committed file, `#F18F18` run observation): say so in the PR body so `Closes #728` closes it knowingly.\n3. **Detail** — same bullet: \"every full forum page links two stylesheets\" then \"a third\": write \"at least two\". `R728g2` answered `Content-Type: text/html`, worth the word \"empty (0 bytes, `text/html`)\".\n\nEverything else checks: fixture sha256 = raw `R728k.html`; `R728k` anon (no jar, no `Set-Cookie`), URL identical to `R728u1`'s first `<link>`; `R728g1` keeps `FFFFFF/DEDFDF` with `degrade`; `W728d1`/`W728r` \"avec succès\", `P728p3`/`p3b` differ only by the « connectés » counter; 98 corpus pages link `/themes/css/defaut/`; `R55-p3` options as stated; meta, MANIFEST row and fragment match `R728a`/`R728b`; no account data in the diff.\n\n**Verified**: `cmp`/sha256 fixture vs raw; link/select/header greps on R728u1, R728g1, R728g2, R728k, P728p2/3/3b/6/7, W728d1, W728r; `python3 -m unittest discover tooling/fixtures/tests` (corpus and MANIFEST agree); `anonymize.py check --corpus` 735/735 clean; `pre-commit run --from-ref 1b290ada~1 --to-ref 1b290ada`; `check-lot-deps.py`; `fold.py --check`. Not run: gitleaks, markdownlint (not installed on this Mac; CI).\n\nAgent: mac/M1-r728-fable (Fable 5.1), posted verbatim by mac/M1.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
