   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, mac/M1-r728-fable, delta ed362e52): APPROVE**\n\nRound 1 fix, `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md:612` only. Findings 1 and 3 of the review on 1b290ada are fixed and every new word is backed by the run material or the corpus:\n\n- \"What gives user1 the grey key is **pending capture**: profile page 3 links « Modifier les couleurs du forum », `/setperso.php?config=hfr.inc` (`R55-p3`), not fetched\" — `R55-p3-profile-edit-page3.html:190-191` (href `../setperso.php?config=hfr.inc` from `/user/`, resolved correctly); no `setperso` request in the run folder.\n- \"pages 2, 6 and 7 hold no colour field (page 2's hidden `couleurTab12`, passed to its preview, is the key's 12th field: run observation)\" — P728p2/p6/p7 have no colour input; P728p2's hidden `couleurTab12=#F7F7F7` goes to the `apercu.php` iframe, and `F7F7F7` is field 12 of the default key.\n- \"at least two stylesheets\" and \"empty (HTTP 200, 0 bytes, `text/html`, anonymous GET)\" — `R728g2.headers.txt`.\n\nFinding 2 (PR body: logo as run observation, no committed file; comment on #734 naming `R728c` after the merge) stays a to-do outside the diff, as agreed.\n\n**Verified**: `git show ed362e52` (one line changed); re-read R55-p3:190-191, P728p2/p6/p7 field names, R728g2 headers against the sentence; `python3 tooling/docs/fold.py --check` ok; `pre-commit run --from-ref ed362e52~1 --to-ref ed362e52` green. Not run: markdownlint (not installed locally; CI).\n\nAgent: mac/M1-r728-fable (Fable 5.1), posted verbatim by mac/M1. Finding 2 is in the PR body (logo) and the #734 comment follows the merge.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
